                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "646bd9eb-842f-3670-b24a-f3a2ffb4299c",
                        "entry_id": "817852cd-a846-3635-8597-f3500bfd0467",
                        "glosses": [
                            "физ. частица-двойник некоторой другой элементарной частицы, обладающая той же массой и тем же спином, но отличающаяся от неё знаками некоторых характеристик взаимодействия"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "072d236b-4897-4c41-b50d-4fa240bed9b5",
                                "sense_id": "646bd9eb-842f-3670-b24a-f3a2ffb4299c",
                                "text": "Было установлено, что не только электрон, но и все остальные частицы имеют свои античастицы."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "51901f87-4b45-4129-b5aa-3dbb70cd2eda",
                        "source_entry_id": "817852cd-a846-3635-8597-f3500bfd0467",
                        "source_sense_id": "646bd9eb-842f-3670-b24a-f3a2ffb4299c",
                        "target_lang_word": "antiparticle",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "antiparticle",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a675d3d5-150b-38a9-b0f0-06e4bae1cf71",
                                        "entry_id": "4b1ac118-e7bd-318c-918f-e964595c237a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A subatomic particle corresponding to another particle with the same mass, spin and mean lifetime but with charge, parity, strangeness and other quantum numbers flipped in sign; a particle that has a reversed world line to another."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "particle"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c897cb19-4e85-46fa-b939-c3ccfa61d662",
                                                "sense_id": "a675d3d5-150b-38a9-b0f0-06e4bae1cf71",
                                                "text": "There could be whole antiworlds and antipeople made out of antiparticles. However, if you meet your antiself, don't shake hands!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "77cb1608-ba5d-4d70-ad0c-af349ee5078f",
                                                "sense_id": "a675d3d5-150b-38a9-b0f0-06e4bae1cf71",
                                                "text": "Particles of matter and antimatter are identical, except for an opposite electrical charge. An electron has a negative charge whereas its antiparticle, the positron, has a positive charge, and both have an identical mass."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "0cb73042-9bb0-4dc8-b384-bec8d32a65a8",
                        "source_entry_id": "817852cd-a846-3635-8597-f3500bfd0467",
                        "source_sense_id": "646bd9eb-842f-3670-b24a-f3a2ffb4299c",
                        "target_lang_word": "antipartícula",
                        "target_lang_code": "es",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "antipartícula",
                                "target_lang_code": "es",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f0525abf-bdb6-3f91-bf28-4616b550b15c",
                                        "entry_id": "0b64198a-d1fe-39dd-ad76-1d65ca54a01b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A cada partícula subatómica le corresponde una antipartícula, que tiene la misma masa, el mismo espín pero con carga eléctrica, paridad, extrañeza y otros números cuánticos invertidos en signo. Las antipartículas forman antiátomos y estos antimateria."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Física"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
